t tax return for Lloyd’s underwriters (Self Assessment helpsheet HS240)</a><br>\nHow to fill in a Lloyd’s underwriter tax return.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The forms and notes for tax year 2025 to 2026 have been added, and the versions for tax year 2021 to 2022 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-05T23:15:18Z"},{"note":"The forms and notes have been added for the 2024 to 2025 tax year. The form and notes for 2020 to 2021 tax year have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:30:10Z"},{"note":"The forms and notes have been added for the 2023 to 2024 tax year.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-05T23:15:18Z"},{"note":"The forms and notes have been added for the tax year 2022 to 2023.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-05T23:15:15Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2021 to 2022, and the versions for tax year 2017 to 2018 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-05T23:15:15Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for the 2020 to 2021 tax year.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2021-04-05T23:30:02Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2019 to 2020.","public_timestamp":"2020-04-05T23:45:00Z"},{"note":"The Lloyd's underwriters form and notes have been added for tax year 2018 to 2019.","public_timestamp":"2019-04-05T23:30:04Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2017 to 2018. ","public_timestamp":"2018-04-05T23:30:19Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2017-04-05T23:30:42Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2016-04-05T23:45:07Z"},{"note":"The 2015 to 2016 form has been added to this page.","public_timestamp":"2015-04-05T23:31:01Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2014-06-25T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Form","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div 